# Use case

{% if problem_type == 'forecasting' %}
Forecast two related hourly series three hours ahead using lagged observations and
known hour-of-day encodings. Chronological cutoffs and purged labels prevent leakage.
{% elif problem_type == 'regression' %}
Predict a continuous outcome from two independent numeric measurements. Synthetic
labels follow a noisy linear relationship. Use a seeded random split for this example.
{% else %}
Predict a binary outcome from two independent numeric measurements. Synthetic labels
follow a noisy linear boundary. Both split stages are stratified by the target.
{% endif %}
A small random forest is a baseline. Extract the data contract, transformations,
leakage-aware split, training and scoring modules when migrating an existing notebook.
